WEBVTT

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:11.310
Even if I tell you the winner is given
the right to battle the strongest youma?

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.390
Kagura, don't listen to her.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:14.780
She's lying.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:15.790
That's right.

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.790
If you're giving somebody
the right to fight it,

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.030
that means the "strongest youma"
is working for you, doesn't it?

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.040
Then how can I make you believe me?

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.360
If you're strong enough
to make a youma obey you,

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.170
maybe?

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:32.800
I see.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:34.750
Then...

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.690
Will this do?

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:52.990
Kagura?

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:54.640
Wow!

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.950
I guess that means
I can get serious, too!

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:09.210
What's your name?

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:12.210
Fubuki.

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:13.720
I see.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:15.300
Fubuki...

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:18.970
Don't disappoint me.

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:35.990
<b><i>Sen</i></b>

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:36.740
<b><i>Ran</i></b>

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:37.450
<b><i>Kagura</i></b>

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:37.780
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.950
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.950
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:01.550
Kagura...

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:07.070
I see.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.880
When did she even attack?

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:17.780
I couldn't see it at all.

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.420
This strength...

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.320
Who are you, really?

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:29.130
You won't answer me?

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.980
Then I'll get the answer
from you by force!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:37.920
What?

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:38.740
When did they get here?

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:40.360
I couldn't sense them at all!

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:43.260
Fubuki-sama,

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:44.870
we've come for you.

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:49.270
Who am I?

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.920
If you want to know...

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:53.480
enter the Shinobi Masters.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.850
I'll be waiting.

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:05.820
Kagura...

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:07.300
Are you okay?

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:10.160
<i>Shinobi Masters?</i>

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:28.550
Haruka-sama,

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.170
is Homura okay?

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:33.550
Her wounds aren't fatal.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:35.960
We just need to wait
for her to wake up.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:38.830
Who did this to her?

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:42.170
The wound on her arm
came from a katana.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.510
Then it was a shinobi?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.320
Yes, most likely.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:52.010
But there aren't a lot of shinobi
who could do this to her.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:56.730
I'll tell them we're not participating
in the Shinobi Masters.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.300
She's awake!

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:00.090
Homura-chan!

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.660
Homura!

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:01.660
Homura-san!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.530
Asuka...

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.660
Why did you...?

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.060
<b><i>Gessen
 Girls'
 Academy
 Newsletter</i></b>

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:39.610
One-two! One-two!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.370
Again! One-two! One-two!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:46.040
Focus on the muscles in your butt!

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:50.950
One-two! One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.920
One-two! One-two!

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:57.060
<i>This training that
Shiki-san came up with...</i>

00:05:57.060 --> 00:06:00.370
<i>With the Shinobi Masters coming up,</i>

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:02.460
<i>it seems a little too easy.</i>

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:07.470
<i>But there must be some
reason she chose it.</i>

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.560
<i>Which means I have
to give it my full effort!</i>

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.660
One-two! One-two!

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.130
No more...

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:17.800
I'm exhausted.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:19.000
Minori-chin,

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.220
don't wimp out on me!

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:23.830
You won't be able to work off the calories
from the cake you just ate!

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.410
You too, Mura-chin.

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.110
How many of those rice
balls did you have?

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:30.670
Um...

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:33.130
Shiki-san, if I may?

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.200
What is it?

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:37.280
What is the goal of this training?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:39.150
Weight loss, obviously.

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:40.450
Weight loss?

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.330
At a critical time like this?

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.160
It is a critical time!

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:46.090
Christmas is coming,

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:49.820
and we'll be around a lot of
good food at a lot of parties.

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:52.050
That's not what I meant!

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:52.760
Yumi...

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:56.140
Yozakura-san.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.640
What is it?

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.650
<b><i>Gessen Girls' Academy Newsletter</i></b>

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.230
Look at this.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:05.070
It's the Gessen Girls' Academy
 official newsletter.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:08.400
Look at the photo in the top left.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:12.030
It looks like a middle school
athletic tournament.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.040
Look closer at the tent in the back.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.530
That's...!

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:19.530
Gekkou and Senkou.

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:20.300
Seriously?

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.540
They go to our middle school?

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.870
What do we do, Yumi?

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:30.420
We'll need to look into this.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.820
<i>Grandpa Kurokage...</i>

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:24.920
<i>"It's not as dazzlingly bright as the sun,</i>

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:28.100
<i>but it's the last light that
illuminates the darkness.</i>

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.130
<i>That's the kind of justice
you must be, like the moon."</i>

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:33.440
<i>Those were your words,
Grandpa Kurokage.</i>

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.560
<i>And I'll never forget them.</i>

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:39.180
<i>Ever.</i>

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:01.390
I'm home.

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:25.080
I've never been to the
middle school before!

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.220
Me neither.

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:27.040
The same for me.

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:31.180
We'll stand out in our
high school uniforms.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:34.720
Wait, aren't you super famous
at Gessen, Yumi-chin?

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.700
You'll stand out with or without the uniform.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.790
I will?

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:42.230
Could that be Yumi-sama?

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:44.140
Yumi-sama! It's Yumi-sama!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.720
She's really here, right?

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:47.070
What's going on?

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:48.930
Yumi-sama is here, I heard!

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:50.100
What?

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:52.110
<i>The</i> Yumi-sama? Where? Where?

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:55.730
Yumi-chin, you're the leader
of the top team in the school!

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:58.590
Everyone in the middle
school will recognize you!

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:01.240
We won't be able to infiltrate it, then.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:04.100
I should disguise myself, I guess.

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:07.170
How about this?

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:10.020
A lady teacher! I like it!

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:10.940
Well?

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:12.760
Do I look like a teacher?

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.800
Y-Yeah... maybe?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.230
Depending on how you look at it.

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:19.060
Let's go with this, then!

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:27.520
I don't think there are any
teachers who look like that.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.630
Let's come up with a new plan.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.100
Aw...

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:39.850
Perfect!

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:42.960
We can still pass as JC!

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:45.760
Looks like Murakumo's
just barely passing, too.

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:49.230
Everyone,

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:52.220
even if we find Gekkou and Senkou,

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:54.290
don't attack on sight.

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:59.930
If a battle breaks out, the innocent
middle schoolers will end up getting hurt.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.380
Okay, got it!

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:03.800
Stay calm at all times, right?

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:06.890
Well then, let's go.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:17.570
<b><i>Senran Kagura</i></b>

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:17.570
<b><i>- Tokyo Youma Chapter -</i></b>

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:20.250
Yumi,

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.800
where do we start?

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:23.820
Hmm...

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:27.330
Let's start with the gym.

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:49.970
They're not here, either.

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:51.310
They aren't.

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.360
What's wrong, Yumi?

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:59.460
Shiki-san, Minori-san...

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:01.120
I don't see Murakumo-san.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:03.620
They've got shortcake!

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:07.130
Shiki-chan, give me some money.

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:08.120
Money?

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:09.710
You're going to eat some cake?

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:11.330
It's a cafeteria.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.330
It's suspicious if you don't eat anything.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.380
She has a point.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.680
I see!

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.880
We wouldn't want to look suspicious, would we?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.370
Right?

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:20.260
Exactly.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.190
Let's eat!

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.670
<i>It's so good!</i>

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:29.310
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.640
<i>This is great!</i>

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.140
<i>Yum, yum...</i>

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:37.150
Do they suspect us?

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:38.150
Yup...

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.800
We finally found them.

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:13.810
Excuse me!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.060
Gekkou-san! Senkou-san!

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.610
About the student council's budget...

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:21.610
They're involved in the 
student council too, it seems.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.020
This'll do it.

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:23.480
Here.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:24.610
Thanks so much for the help.

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.040
Look at all those cakes!

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:33.350
I want some, too.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:37.120
But I don't have a lot of
allowance left this month.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:38.370
Me neither.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.940
Let's eat together.

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.050
There's a lot here,

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:45.160
and it'll be more fun and taste
better if we eat together!

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.360
You're sure?

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.950
Of course! Right?

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.200
Sure!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.210
Of course.

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:53.140
Feel free to join in.

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:56.180
All right, if you're sure.

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:59.930
So, can I ask you two a question?

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:01.610
What is it?

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:04.820
Are there two jerks named
Gekkou and Senkou—

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.330
I mean, two students?

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:11.160
We just transferred in.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.160
Oh, I see.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:13.810
Here.

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:15.040
Thank you.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.900
Of course we know them.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:19.410
If you mean the sisters
Gekkou-san and Senkou-san.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:21.040
Huh?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.860
And what are those assholes—

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:25.950
I mean, what are they like?

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:27.730
The word I'd choose would be...

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:29.340
Perfect!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.430
Perfect?

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.990
They're talented at everything,

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:37.930
from being shinobi,
to studying, to sports,

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:40.520
to cultural activities!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.940
That's right!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:42.990
But they're not arrogant.

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:47.390
They're also friendly with everybody.

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:50.640
They're really amazing!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.210
Geh... Seriously?

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:56.020
I mean, they're that amazing?

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:57.960
I'd love to meet them.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.460
Please do!

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:04.340
They're always in the same
place this time of day.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.200
O-Okay...

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.630
We lost them.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:28.590
How?

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:29.710
This is the roof.

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:32.370
I never thought you'd follow us here.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.820
We'll send you another letter by arrow

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.290
concerning the Shinobi Masters.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:49.000
So stop sneaking
around and stalking us.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:52.450
As a fellow student of Gessen,
let me ask you...

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:55.290
Why is getting us to participate
in the Shinobi Masters so important

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:59.020
that you took the Hanzo students hostage?

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:01.810
As a fellow student of Gessen?

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.260
Ridiculous.

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.460
You're beyond saving.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:07.520
You really don't understand!

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:08.900
Yumi, here they come!

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:17.650
<i>She's strong.</i>

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:45.520
Yumi-chin! Yozakura-chin!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.360
We'll join in the fight!

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:51.940
Wait!

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:55.740
If we fight with our full strength here,

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:59.330
it may cause trouble for the
middle school students.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.070
B-But...

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:03.170
Is that your justice?

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:07.210
What a nauseating platitude.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.110
I admit that you're strong.

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:13.930
But power is nothing
without righteousness.

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:16.130
That's a strange thing to say.

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.640
Isn't justice just another
word for those with power?

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:22.640
Then you're saying
the weak have no justice?

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:23.750
Yes.

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:24.640
That's right.

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:28.880
Then your definition of justice
is different than ours!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.150
Yeah!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:32.050
How sad.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:35.290
Kurokage-sama took you in,

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:37.570
and yet you would abandon
his noble teachings.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:40.030
Yumi-senpai, you in particular.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:43.080
You're his own granddaughter.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.840
It's disgusting to see
how far you've fallen.

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:47.670
Even at this school,

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:51.410
Kurokage-sama's
existence is now taboo.

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:55.840
That's why we will carry
on his teachings.

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:02.350
Grandpa Kurokage's teachings?

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.290
What's wrong? Fight harder!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:21.420
<i>All five of them are well-prepared
for the Shinobi Masters.</i>

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:22.560
<i>From the look of things,</i>

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:25.770
<i>no one will beat them easily.</i>

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.500
<b>...eruption of harmful gases in surrounding sea for several kilometers...</b>

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:36.510
<b>...eruption of harmful gases in surrounding sea for several kilometers...</b>

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:29.010
<i>But something's bothering me.</i>

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:34.860
<i>All the jonin have gathered at
the Kikai Dome for a secret mission.</i>

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:41.560
<i>If the Shinobi Masters was planned
to take place at this point...</i>

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:45.090
Miyabi!

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:47.150
It's Gekkou and Senkou!

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:47.150
Where are they?

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:48.520
Ignore them.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.280
There's no need to follow them.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.370
Here it is.

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:58.560
The official location and date
of the Shinobi Masters tournament!

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:59.650
Great!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.000
I can still make it.

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:19.010
I'll protect everyone!

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.580
It's like a concert.

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:57.820
What is this?

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:00.590
What's with the fancy show?

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.800
Be careful.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.960
It might be a trap.

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:08.620
It's fine to be careful.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:11.350
But a coward will never
be the strongest.

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:15.050
We're only participating in the Shinobi
Masters tournament

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:18.850
to save the students from Hanzo.

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:32.870
You can't talk about good and evil
unless you watch this tournament.

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:36.380
Shinobi Masters, the tournament
to decide the strongest shinobi

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.870
is finally about to begin!

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:49.640
Shinobi from all over the world
are watching the tournament right now!

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:51.340
What's going on?

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:56.900
It's being streamed live
 on a shinobi video site.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:01.900
We will now have our opening speech!

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:17.040
I am Fubuki,

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.370
she who put on this tournament.

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:24.200
I have summoned strong warriors
who meet my requirements,

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:29.010
from the various
shinobi schools, to this place.

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:36.690
I've seen her somewhere before.

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:44.200
The Shinobi Masters
tournament will now begin!

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:30.060
There's no guarantee you'll return
with all your limbs attached.

00:23:30.060 --> 00:23:32.310
Are you all ready?

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:35.610
We're doing this to save the
students from Hanzo Academy.

00:23:35.610 --> 00:23:38.230
We owe them a lot, you see.
